        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Unit Overall Teaching Design Process</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            color: #333;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        /* Top Section */\n        .top-section {\n            padding: 20px 40px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .header-box {\n            background-color: #1a5b9e;\n            color: white;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 5px 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .main-title {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 10px;\n            right: 40px;\n            font-size: 64px;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: white;\n            text-shadow: \n                -2px -2px 0 #000,  \n                 2px -2px 0 #000,\n                -2px  2px 0 #000,\n                 2px  2px 0 #000;\n            letter-spacing: 5px;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        .sub-title {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            text-indent: 2em;\n        }\n\n        .paragraph {\n            text-indent: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #555;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n\n        /* Highlight styles */\n        .highlight-circle {\n            display: inline-block;\n            border: 2px solid #e7823b;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            padding: 2px 5px;\n            margin: 0 2px;\n            color: #555;\n        }\n        \n        .underline-dashed-red {\n            border-bottom: 2px dashed #ff0040;\n            padding-bottom: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* Bottom Section */\n        .bottom-section {\n            padding: 20px 40px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee; /* Assuming some separation */\n        }\n\n        .section-heading {\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #c0392b; /* Dark red */\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .section-heading span.number {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-right: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .bold-text {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"top-section\">\n        <div class=\"header-box\">单元整体教学设计过程</div>\n        <h1 class=\"main-title\">2·再构文本</h1>\n        \n        <h2 class=\"sub-title\">有效再构教学文本</h2>\n\n        <p class=\"paragraph\">\n            文本再构能够有效解决教材不能满足现实教学需求的问题，从而为实现对单元主题的深度学习、培养学生的学科核心素养提供基础保障。\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"paragraph\">\n            首先它需要教师基于单元主题及主题意义，合理划分各单课时话题。每个单课时话题不仅要与主题相关，更要具有一定的关联性、递进性，凸显对主题意义的探究。\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"paragraph\">\n            其次，在明确了各单课时的话题后，教师可以将教材中的教学内容根据分课时话题教学需要及学生已有的知识储备情况，进行一定<span class=\"highlight-circle\">重组</span>、<span class=\"highlight-circle\">调整</span>、<span class=\"highlight-circle\">删减</span>、<span class=\"highlight-circle\">补充</span>或延伸，使教学文本内容更具层次、语言更为丰富、呈现方式更加多样、情境更加贴近学生现实生活，<span class=\"underline-dashed-red\">更有利于培养学生的语用能力和核心素养。</span>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n            <span class=\"number\">1.</span> 树立正确的教材观\n        </div>\n        \n        <p class=\"paragraph\">\n            教师在日常教学中不应被教材所束缚，按部就班地按照教材来教，而应该做“<span class=\"bold-text underline-dashed-red\">教材的主人”，创造性地使用教材。</span>\n        </p>\n        \n        <p class=\"paragraph\">\n            <span class=\"bold-text\">教师以单元为单位，深度挖掘教学文本潜藏的育人价值，并将文本解读与学情分析结合起来，提炼单元主题意义，并基于此有效整合教学内容，再构教学文本。</span>这样一来可以帮助教师开展有逻辑、有层次的单元主题教学，可以帮助学生形成对单元主题逐步深入的认知。\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
